    "title": "OnePlayer - Video Downloader",
    "description": "OnePlayer supports playing all video formats, including 4K/Ultra HD, with high-definition playback. The app also supports watching videos online and offline. You can download videos from any website with this app.\r\n\r\n OnePlayer supports setting a lock for your private video vault, protecting your private videos from being deleted or seen by others. \r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udca1 Features \ud83d\udca1</b>  \r\n- Support casting videos to TV\r\n- Play video in the pop-up window\r\n- High-speed video downloader\r\n- Private Video Vault to protect privacy \r\n- Support watching videos online and offline\r\n- Powerful built-in player to play downloaded videos  \r\n- Easy to control volume, brightness, and playing progress\r\n- Multi playback option: auto-rotation, aspect-ratio, screen-lock, etc\r\n- Support ALL video formats, including MKV, MP4, M4V, AVI, MOV, 3GP, FLV, WMV, RMVB, TS etc\r\n\r\nOnePlayer top features\r\n\ud83c\udfa6 <b>Full-featured Video Player</b>\r\nOnePlayer supports fast and stable playback of all video formats. Fast playback of all HD, UHD, 4K, and 1080P videos. Stream online videos directly. Easily adjust volume, brightness, or progress with a swipe. It supports auto-rotation, aspect ratio, and screen lock.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d <b>High-speed Video Downloader</b>\r\nDownload online videos by simply pasting the URL. Easily build your video library with content from various online sources. Watch downloaded videos in the app for smooth playback, anytime, anywhere. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac <b>Floating Video Player</b>\r\nBoost your productivity with our floating video player! Watch videos while using other apps. Move and resize the player effortlessly. Enjoy split-screen multitasking like never before.\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Screen-casting Video Player</b>\r\nCast your videos to a larger screen effortlessly. Enjoy your favorite content on the big screen with ease. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd10 <b>Private Video Vault</b> \r\nAdd a password lock to your videos, ensuring that only you can view them. You can easily organize and categorize your videos in this private space. Try this powerful video player now! \r\n\r\nDiscover the perfect video companion! Our app offers seamless playback, supports all formats, and enhances your viewing experience. \r\n\r\nOneplayer is the ultimate HD video player, combining simplicity with power. Enjoy seamless playback of any video format with our all-in-one media player. We've got you covered whether it's MP4, AVI, MKV, or moreMKV, or more, we've got you covered. Experience high-definition quality and effortless control as you dive into a world of entertainment. Upgrade your video viewing experience today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "OnePlayer supports playing all video formats, including 4K/Ultra HD, with high-definition playback. The app also supports watching videos online and offline. You can download videos from any website with this app.<br><br> OnePlayer supports setting a lock for your private video vault, protecting your private videos from being deleted or seen by others. <br><br><b>\ud83d\udca1 Features \ud83d\udca1</b>  <br>- Support casting videos to TV<br>- Play video in the pop-up window<br>- High-speed video downloader<br>- Private Video Vault to protect privacy <br>- Support watching videos online and offline<br>- Powerful built-in player to play downloaded videos  <br>- Easy to control volume, brightness, and playing progress<br>- Multi playback option: auto-rotation, aspect-ratio, screen-lock, etc<br>- Support ALL video formats, including MKV, MP4, M4V, AVI, MOV, 3GP, FLV, WMV, RMVB, TS etc<br><br>OnePlayer top features<br>\ud83c\udfa6 <b>Full-featured Video Player</b><br>OnePlayer supports fast and stable playback of all video formats. Fast playback of all HD, UHD, 4K, and 1080P videos. Stream online videos directly. Easily adjust volume, brightness, or progress with a swipe. It supports auto-rotation, aspect ratio, and screen lock.<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d <b>High-speed Video Downloader</b><br>Download online videos by simply pasting the URL. Easily build your video library with content from various online sources. Watch downloaded videos in the app for smooth playback, anytime, anywhere. <br><br>\ud83d\udcac <b>Floating Video Player</b><br>Boost your productivity with our floating video player! Watch videos while using other apps. Move and resize the player effortlessly. Enjoy split-screen multitasking like never before.<br><br>\u2728 <b>Screen-casting Video Player</b><br>Cast your videos to a larger screen effortlessly. Enjoy your favorite content on the big screen with ease. <br><br>\ud83d\udd10 <b>Private Video Vault</b> <br>Add a password lock to your videos, ensuring that only you can view them. You can easily organize and categorize your videos in this private space. Try this powerful video player now! <br><br>Discover the perfect video companion! Our app offers seamless playback, supports all formats, and enhances your viewing experience. <br><br>Oneplayer is the ultimate HD video player, combining simplicity with power. Enjoy seamless playback of any video format with our all-in-one media player. We&#39;ve got you covered whether it&#39;s MP4, AVI, MKV, or moreMKV, or more, we&#39;ve got you covered. Experience high-definition quality and effortless control as you dive into a world of entertainment. Upgrade your video viewing experience today!",
